<title>FRANCE: Air France to decide soon on cargo tariffs.</title>
<headline>Air France to decide soon on cargo tariffs.</headline>
<dateline>PARIS 1996-10-29</dateline>
<text>
<p>Air France said it would decided tonight or on Wednesday morning whether it would increase its cargo tariffs due to an increase in fuel prices.</p>
<p>&quot;We will decide this evening or tomorrow morning. It will be for cargo tariffs only,&quot; a spokeswoman said.</p>
<p>-- Paris newsroom +33 1 4221 5452</p>
